        "cooked": "<p>if i played 2 slow power, i choose outpaced`s first solution(stay steady and slow),</p>\n<p>i discards 2 slow power?</p>\n<p>outpaced`s 'power card' is all of i played slow cards in spirit phase?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
